  DisplayName: An Antiquarian Society Fills Its Cabinet
  EventType: 1
  Description: A learned society of antiquaries {has received|will receive} a large
    bequest and {is resolved|is expected} to spend it on the earliest pieces it can
    find. Its secretaries {are writing|will write} to every reputable dealer, and
    the trade in the oldest centuries {is stirring|will stir} for the first time
    in years.
